<title>JAPAN: Sanrio bid-only on 'Hello Kitty' boom.</title>
<headline>Sanrio bid-only on 'Hello Kitty' boom.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Sanrio Co Ltd, a leading manufacturer of gift merchandise, were bid-only on Tuesday, helped by the rising popularity of its &quot;Hello Kitty&quot; character among youth, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0426 GMT, the shares were bid-only at 940 yen, against Monday's close of 870 yen.</p>
</text>
